The upstream control client is not included. This product does not send
actuation, camera, reboot, or raw-command topics.

Coordinate policy "grid" follows the raw-minus-origin placement described for
the earlier sytchi map client (referenced commit f527b72). That tree was not
present in this build, and no sytchi source was copied.
